        "original_id": "1be5c98b-94a3-56a7-90f5-c33758aa1e4c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosi Golan, Lena Meyer-Landrut, Jennifer Braun, Mayaeni Strauss, Per Kristian Ottestad\n- Songs: \"Bee\"\n- Brands: Chicco\n- Companies: Artsana, Pantene, J. C. Penney, Walmart\n- Films and TV shows: \"Dear John\", \"Tiger Eyes\", \"The Vampire Diaries\", \"Grey's Anatomy\", \"Private Practice\", \"Brothers & Sisters\", \"One Tree Hill\", \"Ghost Whisperer\"\n\nFacts:\n- Chicco is a brand of Artsana that has worked in children's products for over 50 years and is present in more than 120 countries.\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the films \"Dear John\" and \"Tiger Eyes\".\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the television shows \"The Vampire Diaries\", \"Grey's Anatomy\", \"Private Practice\", \"Brothers & Sisters\", \"One Tree Hill\", and \"Ghost Whisperer\".\n- Rosi Golan's songs have also been used in commercials for Chicco, Pantene, J. C. Penney, and Walmart.\n- \"Bee\" is a song recorded by Lena Meyer-Landrut and Jennifer Braun.\n- \"Bee\" was composed by Rosi Golan, Mayaeni Strauss, and Per Kristian Ottestad.",
